	)
	(text "Inductor characterization\nXFL4015-471MEC recommended from datasheet (Texas Instrument SLVSEF9I)\nOperating Voltage = 0-20 V\nDC Resistance = 7.6 mOhms\nSelf Resonant Frequency = 89 MHz\nSaturation Current > 3 A\nL is stable from 1 to 10 MHz\nL derates after 3A\nL = (Vin-Vsw-Vo)*(Vo+0.5)/(Vin-Vsw-0.5)/(Vripple/ESR_outputcapacitor)/fsw/Iout_max"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.574 166.37 0)
		(effects
